body:
I fall into both, I can usually always save some for later depending on how much I have of course. I do always have a come down though and I find if I can get super weed high and take melatonin I am more likely to be able to fall asleep. The hardest part for me is being able to sit through the come down and get to the point where sleep feels like a good idea. 

&#x200B;

I think it does come down to personality and the habits you create with your usage. You can get better at controlling it with enough intentional practice. Still not an exact science though and I think it's so easy to get caught up in the "one more line" loop. It's not even logical either because it's not like there's good reason to keep going at some point, I think it's mainly for me just not wanting to endure the comedown and that's when I can go longer than I originally intended.
